{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">巴西舉行總統選舉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首輪投票將於本港時間明早八時結束，爭取連任的總統盧拉到票站投票，今次選舉被視為他同前總統博爾索納羅長子弗拉維奧的對決。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.VOTE-2030.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ANk227LYaJ1791119805.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BRA.VOTE-2030.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">民調顯示兩人支持度接近，預料要到月底的次輪投票，才能分出勝負。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.VOTE-2030_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026z0X3a4kGj61791119821.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BRA.VOTE-2030_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T13:58:25.408988+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}